/* The cash flow calendar (Level 13, MR-067). Every tab is a reading of the
   one day-by-day run in engine/cashcal.js: the month grid, the weeks, the
   balance line with the floor and the outlook band, the paycheck map, the
   year strip, the agenda, and the cards. The tools (can I spend this, the
   bill timing fixer, the outlook, an income shock, life events, the spend
   logger, the weekly check-in, dates and the floor) are drawers. The
   Ledger owns the amounts; this screen owns only the timing, written to
   record.calendar through the record API. Views never do math. */
